<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 7,476 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 113.55 pence a kilo against 116.53 last week and 111.39 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 239,714 pkgs sold so far this year is 112.89 pence against 101.48 pence for the 344,681 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
